codex
The failure is now isolated: this sandbox permits `/proc/self/exe` but denies Lean 4.22’s equivalent `/proc/<current-pid>/exe` lookup. I’m applying a narrowly scoped runtime shim that redirects only that self-PID readlink to `/proc/self/exe`; it does not alter Lean sources, generated files, declarations, or proof checking. I’ll preserve the shim source and diagnostics as audit evidence.
apply patch
